    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://peterbenjaminzhu.github.io/en/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:24:32 +0800</pubDate>
      <author>19973397352@163.com (Peter Benjamin Zhu)</author>
      <guid>https://peterbenjaminzhu.github.io/en/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;About This Site&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;about-this-site&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#about-this-site&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is a platform where a student of theoretical physics records and shares what he learns and researches.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;About Me&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;about-me&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#about-me&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am &lt;strong&gt;Peter Benjamin Zhu&lt;/strong&gt;, an undergraduate student, known online in Chinese as &lt;strong&gt;学物理的咸鱼&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Struggling to stay afloat in the ocean of physics&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Interests&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;interests&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#interests&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My interests in theoretical physics include:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Classical gravity&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Quantum gravity&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Black holes&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The anti-de Sitter/conformal field theory correspondence (AdS/CFT correspondence)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Cosmology&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Interest categories: &lt;strong&gt;hep-th&lt;/strong&gt; (High Energy Physics - Theory) and &lt;strong&gt;gr-qc&lt;/strong&gt; (General Relativity and Quantum Cosmology).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
